1. DEFINITIONS

   "The Author" refers to Nukerhugo (https://nukerhugo.nl/).
   "The Software" refers to Nukerhugo Code: the source code,
   documentation, and all associated files in the repository this
   license is distributed with, and the builds of it that the Author
   publishes ("Official Builds").
   "Nukerhugo AI Service" refers to the AI API operated by the Author
   at https://nukerhugo.nl/ai/, including its Enterprise API, and any
   successor service operated by the Author.
   "Personal Use" means use by a single individual for non-commercial
   purposes on their own devices, or within a small private group such
   as a household or a non-commercial team, with no public
   distribution.
   "Fork" means any copy, derivative work, or modified version of the
   Software intended for redistribution or public sharing.
   "Your Output" means files, code, text, and other content that you
   create, change, or obtain by using the Software, excluding the
   Software itself.
   "Commercial Use" means any use of the Software, in whole or in part,
   that directly or indirectly generates revenue, is used in a product
   or service offered for payment, or is used within a commercial
   organization to provide business value. Commercial Use does not
   include the uses permitted by Sections 2(d) and 2(e).

