   b) COMMERCIAL USE — Except as allowed in Sections 2(d) and 2(e), you
      may not use the Software, in whole or in part, for any Commercial
      Use without explicit written permission from the Author. The
      Software is provided as a free resource: except as allowed in
      Sections 2(d) and 2(e), you may not earn revenue from the
      Software itself, directly or indirectly (for example by selling,
      licensing, or hosting it, or by including it in a paid product or
      service).

